 align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">CGTCTTTAGGAAGGCATGGA</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">FLNB (Mm)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">CCCAAACTCAACCCAAAGAA</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">CCTTCTGGGTCCTCAACAAA</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">EGR1 (Mm)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">GAGCGAACAACCCTATGAGC</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">GGGATAACTCGTCTCCACCA</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">RET (Mm)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">ACAAGAGGCCAGTGTTTGCT</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">GTGAGTCCGAAGGTGTGGAT</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Comparison of target gene fold induction by aRA between microarray data (outside parenthesis) and competitive RT&#x02013;PCR results (inside parenthesis) in neuroblastoma cells treated with 10&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> aRA</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th colspan="4" align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>SH-SY5Y</bold></th><th colspan="4" align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>BE(2)-C</bold></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Gene description</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>GeneBank accession</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>1&#x02009;h</bold></th><th align="center" valign="